invariant: INV-35
file: Makefile
catches: test/lib-check-webpki-tcp-nonblocking.sh
reason: The object's header writes a comment where it writes an #error
  for a define the object lacks. A consumer whose own flags define such
  an axis then compiles under the header and declares layouts the object
  does not have, and lib-check's consumer with a transport define the
  object lacks no longer stops at the header (docs/decisions.md 133).

--- old
	    printf '#ifdef %s\n#error "the chapulin object was built without %s: drop the define"\n#endif\n' "$$a" "$$a"; \
--- new
	    printf '#ifdef %s\n// "the chapulin object was built without %s: drop the define"\n#endif\n' "$$a" "$$a"; \
